              <li>• <strong>Spring (Apr-Jun):</strong> Waterfalls at peak flow from snowmelt, the best window for the Mist Trail</li>
              <li>• <strong>Summer (Jul-Aug):</strong> Full high-country access, heaviest crowds and Valley heat</li>
              <li>• <strong>Fall (Sep-Oct):</strong> Waterfalls thin out, but crowds thin faster — a good trade for the Valley-floor trails</li>
              <li>• <strong>Winter (Nov-Mar):</strong> Tioga Road closed; Valley floor trails stay open and are often the quietest of the year</li>
